      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……これからはシエラ様が、お父上の分まで\r\nこの国を良くしてくれるんだよな。",
        "official_en": "Emperor Shera is going to work hard in his father’s stead and make things better for us, right?",
        "real_en": "From now on, Shera-sama will make this country better\r\nin his father's place, won't he?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
