        "official_en_sha256": "98b1a6dc54b01f9c834b1889f3f7f534606b5651595048f1207674978b023220"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いつか、自由に遊べる日がくるからね。\r\nそれまでの辛抱だ。",
        "official_en": "I promise that one day, you’ll be free to run around and play outside all you want. Until then, you’ll just have to be patient, deary.",
        "real_en": "Someday you'll be free to go out and play as much as you like. Just be patient until then."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
