      "text": {
        "jp": "これまで我慢していた分、\r\nめいっぱい遊ぼうね。",
        "official_en": "You’ve spent far too much time cooped up inside the house... Let your little legs do all the running and jumping around you want.",
        "real_en": "We've been patient long enough. Let's go have all the fun we can!"
      },
